## Development Guidelines (Developer 3 Focus)
- Use TypeScript for all new code with strict typing
- Focus on business logic and data integration
- Implement proper error handling and loading states for data operations
- Create React hooks and services for data management
- Follow AWS Amplify Gen2 patterns for backend integration
- Maintain HIPAA compliance for healthcare data handling
- When you suggest code changes or creating new files please print out the code in the chat so I can look over it and apply it manually. Do not automatically apply changes or create files unless I ask you to.
- Write code that tells the story — it should be clear and self-explanatory, making the logic obvious without needing separate documentation.
- Prioritize business logic
